This Go library is a port of chaptr 1.5.0 by johnthreekay:
https://github.com/johnthreekay/chaptr
The Rust source and this Go port are licensed GPL-3.0-or-later.

2026-10-27: emirrcaglar adapted the Rust implementation to Go, added a
filename CLI, Go tests and benchmarks, and a Rust parity fixture generator.
Upstream Rust source accompanies this workspace in rust/; a Go-only
distribution can identify its origin through the upstream URL above.

Rust parity fixtures derive in part from the supplied corpora:
- Kavita manga and book parser tests (GPL-3.0):
  https://github.com/Kareadita/Kavita
- Mihon ChapterRecognitionTest (Apache-2.0):
  https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon
- Hand-picked and smoke light novel filenames from Nyaa, as supplied with chaptr.

See chaptr/testdata/NOTICE for corpus provenance. The original corpus files in the
upstream chaptr distribution retain per-entry attribution under corpus/.
Fixtures record observed chaptr outputs rather than overriding behavior with
upstream corpus expectations.
